From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: emit real bounded executable-pool and chrome proofs

The strict Firefox gate already requires these two records, but no previous
supported patch emitted them. Report an executable pool only after allocation,
object creation and registration succeed. Report chrome only after successful
submission of a real nonempty on-screen WebRender display list belonging to
the active, unsuppressed browser document; background, empty and failed
transactions cannot qualify. A dialog retains its own document identity.

Neither record proves JIT execution or completed rasterization/scanout.
Keep the existing independent pixel and interaction gates unchanged. Emit a
bounded newline-terminated record with one checked unbuffered write, once per
kind, under the kernel's complete-TTY-write serial boundary. Never retry or
join a partial write.

diff --git a/mfbt/MakOSRuntimeEvidence.h b/mfbt/MakOSRuntimeEvidence.h
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/mfbt/MakOSRuntimeEvidence.h
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+/* This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public
+ * License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
+ * file, You can obtain one at http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. */
+
+#ifndef mozilla_MakOSRuntimeEvidence_h
+#define mozilla_MakOSRuntimeEvidence_h
+
+#ifdef XP_MAKOS
+#  include <stddef.h>
+#  include <unistd.h>
+#  include "mozilla/Atomics.h"
+
+namespace mozilla::makos {
+
+// MakOS's validated fd-2 TTY write is all-or-error and holds SerialGuard
+// across the complete record, including newline translation. Bypass stdio
+// buffering so another CPU cannot splice a kernel diagnostic into this record.
+// Do not retry a short/error write on another transport: joining fragments
+// would manufacture evidence. The one attempt is consumed even on failure.
+template <size_t Size>
+inline bool WriteRuntimeEvidenceOnce(Atomic<bool>& aAttempted,
+                                     const char (&aRecord)[Size]) {
+  static_assert(Size > 1 && Size <= 256, "bounded runtime evidence record");
+  if (aAttempted.exchange(true)) {
+    return false;
+  }
+  const ssize_t written = write(STDERR_FILENO, aRecord, Size - 1);
+  return written == static_cast<ssize_t>(Size - 1);
+}
+
+}  // namespace mozilla::makos
+#endif  // XP_MAKOS
+#endif  // mozilla_MakOSRuntimeEvidence_h
